  "name": "Runemaster Fist of the Ancients scales with 55% AP and 20% SP across ranks without low-level penalty (#13044)",
  "contract": [
    "Fist of the Ancients (ranks 1-7: 712326, 712330-712335) tooltip in Spell.dbc reads: 'Smash an enemy and 1 nearby",
    "enemy with your rune-engraved fists, dealing ${$m1+0+$AP*.55+$SP*0.2} Elemental Damage and triggering your Weapon",
    "Engraving.' Spell.dbc EffectBonusMultiplier[0] is 0 on all ranks and spell_bonus_data had no row for 712326, so",
    "Unit::SpellDamageBonusDone applied 0 AP and 0 SP scaling. Rank 1 (712326, SpellLevel 15, MaxLevel 22) also took",
    "the stock 18.75% low-level spell-power penalty in Unit::CalculateLevelPenalty without IgnoreSpellLevelPenalty.",
    "Level 17 arms (base17, ap17 +2000 AP, sp17 +2000 SP) cast Rank 1 712326 on a level 17 dummy; level 60 arms",
    "(base60, scaled60 +2000 AP +2000 SP) cast Rank 6 712334 on a level 60 dummy, filtering damage by primary target.",
    "All actors equip main-hand and off-hand weapons (SPELL_ATTR3_REQUIRES_OFF_HAND_WEAPON), carry",
    "melee_hit_rating/expertise_rating/melee_crit_rating 10000 (deterministic 2.0x melee-class crits,",
    "Unit.cpp:1754-1755, no miss/dodge/parry) and spell penetration aura 823764 (0 partial resist per ADR 0154;",
    "SchoolMask 28 Fire|Nature|Frost has no armor mitigation). Every Runemaster also holds class PvE tuning aura",
    "887020 (CoA Aura - Runemaster Class, AscensionClassTuning.h:41, Unit.cpp:9401,10068-10076): aura 341",
    "MiscValue 127, BaseLevel 10, MaxLevel 60, BasePoints 0, DieSides 1, RealPointsPerLevel 0.2",
    "(SpellInfo.cpp:479-516 -> +2% = 1.02x at level 17; +11% = 1.11x at level 60). Expected critical damage",
    "deltas: +2000 AP on Rank 1 adds 2*(0.55*2000)*1.02 = 2244 (DieSides 7 spread +/-6*1.02*2 = +/-12.24 ->",
    "2220..2268); +2000 SP on Rank 1 at level 17 adds 2*(0.20*2000)*1.02 = 816 without the 18.75% penalty",
    "(which would yield 2*325*1.02 = 663; band 792..840); Rank 6 at level 60 with +2000 AP and +2000 SP adds",
    "2*(1100+400)*1.11 = 3330 (DieSides 57 spread +/-56*1.11*2 = +/-124.32 -> 3190..3470)."
  ],
